&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 300px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: center"&gt;既発行株式数　＋　新規発行による増加株式数&lt;/p&gt;
